<title>USA: Harmony Holdings sees 1997 net profit.</title>
<headline>Harmony Holdings sees 1997 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harmony Holdings Inc said Wednesday it expected to report a net profit of $1.3 million for fiscal 1997, compared with a net loss of $2.1 million the previous year.</p>
<p>Harmony said in a statement that the earnings were based on expected revenues of $64 million for the year against $60.4 million in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Harmony produces television commercials, music videos, World Wide Web sites.  It also develops television programming and feature films.</p>
